    q: "How much does a Chennai to Yelagiri Hills cab cost?",
    a: "Our 2-Day / 1-Night round-trip cab package from Chennai to Yelagiri Hills starts at ₹7,500 for an AC Sedan (Swift Dzire / Etios), ₹9,200 for a 6-seater Maruti Ertiga, ₹10,800 for a Toyota Innova, ₹12,800 for an Innova Crysta, and ₹15,500 for a 12-seater Tempo Traveller. This covers up to 500 km round trip and 2-day driver bata. Highway FASTag tolls (~₹500–₹600) and parking are payable at actuals."
  },
  {
    q: "Can we do a 1-day same-day trip from Chennai to Yelagiri Hills?",
    a: "Yes, a 1-day same-day trip is possible if you start at 5:00 AM from Chennai (reaching Yelagiri by 9:45 AM, sightseeing until 4:00 PM, and returning by 9:00 PM). However, we strongly recommend the 2-Day / 1-Night package so your family can enjoy the cool hill evenings, sunrise at Swamimalai, and Jalagamparai Waterfalls without rushing."
  },
  {
    q: "Are your drivers experienced with Yelagiri's 14 hairpin bends?",
